  "prefLabel": "Mec 805.02 Water Treatment Technician Examination",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 805.02 Water Treatment Technician Examination. The examination required to be certified by the board of mechanical safety and licensing shall be the successful completion and passing of the examination administered by the Water Quality Association Certified Installer Program at the end of the program.\n\nSource. #13632, eff 7-19-23",
